  "requested_url": "https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/8095/black-forest-cake-i/",
  "title": "Black Forest Cake",
  "description": "This black forest cake has moist chocolate sponge cake layers with cherry filling and sweet whipped cream for the ultimate chocolate gateau experience!",
  "authors": [
    "Linda Greer"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-12-16T18:29:25-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-11-21T18:06:14-05:00",
  "prep_time": "PT50M",
  "cook_time": "PT35M",
  "total_time": "PT175M",
  "yield": [
    "12",
    "1 (9-inch) gateau"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dessert"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "German"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "German"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "2.125 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "0.75 cup unsweetened cocoa powder",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.75 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.75 teaspoon salt",
    "3 eggs",
    "1 cup milk",
    "0.5 cup vegetable oil",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract",
    "2 (20 ounce) cans pitted sour cherries",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup cornstarch",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "3 cups heavy whipping cream",
    "0.33333334326744 cup confectioners' sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aD7ylVtzmiV31af4MqVoe1qfUvE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-01-5bd3c85267a148c68a68e253dd186526.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease and flour two 9-inch round cake pans; line bottoms with parchment paper. Place a medium bowl in the refrigerator to chill before using it to whip the cream.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3FHNjtKmPhllxoR1O6UUpAzPuTM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-02-8dfdb3e8519f4773a29f7cbde61e6dd3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk flour, sugar, cocoa, baking powder, baking soda, and salt together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rWKlafIQTvZOuqnpvsH-nVJnDgM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-03-0ed7ecabbb104299a912a826b562c75d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add eggs, milk, oil, and vanilla; beat until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RG3k5lWQqK9y41m0Fi4gsxsJC5g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-04-abd020107d8349cd9f874779791755eb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour cake batter into the prepared pans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fKg0kXT4UYJajtt-XD3yz2LldSY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-05-0bfa0773f350412685f0a2de7f742df5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in the centers comes out clean, about 35 minutes. Cool layers in pans on wire racks for 10 minutes. Run a paring knife around edges to loosen and invert carefully onto racks to cool completely, 1 to 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Zv6UeAXmBfD0xUMSJeva60kzVRY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-06-ace2d77167ce45c5acba4e4512c12fa7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While cake layers bake, drain cherries for topping, reserving 1/2 cup juice. Combine reserved juice, cherries, sugar, and cornstarch in a 2-quart saucepan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Kz6IxbOQwUvl-02QvuN1DLL13vQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-07-f24e66ba38e54295814d2be3d606d8c5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook, stirring constantly, over low heat until thickened. Stir in vanilla. Let cool at room temperature for 30 minutes. Transfer to the refrigerator to cool completely before assembling cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/33DyH71yqy7GWgSEfvf2jdqbX-A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-08-ce3005e9823c41688361fa7ad58fea67.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the frosting: Combine whipping cream and confectioners' sugar in the chilled medium bowl. Beat with an electric mixer at high speed until stiff peaks form.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YS46mZHTi6F8k4yrX7ccKjzkARo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-10-b7bb037231804a41b62d1eeedaeebcab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Split each cake layer in half horizontally using a long serrated knife.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/451mOwfNxT6M-lkQiBPzWDQW7xc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-11-1add57e63845450ba24898f8a9296889.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tear one layer into crumbs; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aIG4TUT12VDvjMSVA9bBNQ26pIw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-12-9903b0d3581a417cae8197079a24b79a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently brush loose crumbs off top and sides of remaining layers using a pastry brush or your hands. Reserve 1 ½ cups of frosting for piping decorations on cake; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8k0QDapG2l4U81KJde4r1sOsxtU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-13-1-ad2beb43c26b40cd833a3f6b86c793f2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_12.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To assemble, place one cake layer on a cake plate. Spread with 1 cup frosting; top with 3/4 cup cherry topping.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/52V3iA5pykxyBv11xRPk97entl4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-14-1-765c1152d9504d658cff82652378e0a3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_13.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with second cake layer; repeat layers of frosting and cherry topping.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bRgFPf8MxXZ4YTcMfB7KJHN2acA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-15-19721a0573a94725aa76b49ba26ee3df.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_14.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with third cake layer and frost sides of cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lRQyopk-NI695XEaG5Ey_asWBYM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-16-aa9b585cb1bb4d88a062ed37a797a034.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_15.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pat reserved cake crumbs onto sides of cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/doL0215-JLBmjrxbaVW8M5uX27I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-17-20ddfe3725ec4ccd8b28ede7479a4243.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_16.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon reserved 1 ½ cups frosting into a pastry bag fitted with a star decorator tip. Pipe around top and bottom edges of cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CUesqJ9dXE31AxjKci6QeMXBcfU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-18-76f59e412f234e00bf71dc5a24a0d518.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_17.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon remaining cherry topping on top of cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eaCyXnEiGmmIquv-MlLxwxAtjfQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-Step-19-aa259a3d62634e388ac02d0f9670c1f7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_18.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Store covered in the refrigerator until ready to serve. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WkIeZXMl0NxzMLVwvQm9pfYVtPI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8095-black-forest-cake-beauty-4x3-3df4387fe611404abdce43ab4aca38f5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8095/step_19.webp"
    }
  ],
